    {
      "id": "QkW4uY4DRVG-IgBQB8FvN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 83.10979829438452,
      "y": -249,
      "width": 821.2399772504878,
      "height": 320,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ap",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 730719396,
      "version": 548,
      "versionNonce": 2111422244,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789578904350,
      "created": 1789578519508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key Differences\n\n*** LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): \n- Tracks how long it takes for the main content (like a hero image or big heading) to show on the\nscreen.\n*** INP (Interaction to Next Paint): \n- Tracks how fast the page reacts when a user clicks, taps, or types. \n\nTarget Scores\n- LCP Good Score: Under 2.5 seconds.\n- INP Good Score: 200 milliseconds or less. \n\nCommon Causes of Poor Scores\n- Slow LCP: Large image files, slow server response times, or blocking JavaScript.\n0 Slow INP: Heavy JavaScript execution or too many tasks running on the main browser thread\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key Differences\n\n*** LCP (Largest Contentful Paint): \n- Tracks how long it takes for the main content (like a hero image or big heading) to show on the screen.\n*** INP (Interaction to Next Paint): \n- Tracks how fast the page reacts when a user clicks, taps, or types. \n\nTarget Scores\n- LCP Good Score: Under 2.5 seconds.\n- INP Good Score: 200 milliseconds or less. \n\nCommon Causes of Poor Scores\n- Slow LCP: Large image files, slow server response times, or blocking JavaScript.\n0 Slow INP: Heavy JavaScript execution or too many tasks running on the main browser thread\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
